  "prefLabel": "Crv 103.07 Minutes of Commission Meetings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Crv 103.07 Minutes of Commission Meetings.\n\n(a) Minutes shall be kept of commission meetings and of official actions taken.\n\n(b) Such minutes shall:\n\n(1) Record the commission members participating in each vote; and\n\n(2) Separately record the position of commission members who dissent, abstain or concur.\n\nSource. #7567, eff 9-28-01",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/crv100.html"
